    "title": "Kinetic Forces",
    "description": "Act IV (part a) of the Vector & Forces field — the kinetic forces, at the size of your body. A park of five walk-in installations: push the mower and watch work fall as the handle rises (W = F d cos θ); walk air → water → honey and feel drag bill you for speed; step on the pad and be launched; stand inside the centrifuge ring and feel the inward pull grow with v²/r; stand at a barycenter while two bodies wheel around you. This is the act that closes at body scale. Teleporter onward to Act IV-b — oscillation and balance.\n\n[Placement applied humanoid_walker engine — constraint 0.960→0.899, walkability 0.553→0.963]",
